# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo regardless of the OS/editor that
# touched the file. Without this, Windows tools periodically rewrite text
# files with CRLF, and git sees every line in the file as "changed" even
# though nothing semantically differs — e.g. blogPosts.ts and 22 SVG blog
# images showed up as a ~4,300-line diff on 2026-07-04 that turned out to be
# 100% line-ending noise, zero real content change.
* text=auto eol=lf
